name: sim.getObjectColor
description: Retrieves the color of a scene object
luaSynopsis: list rgbData = sim.getObjectColor(int objectHandle, int index, int colorComponent)
pythonSynopsis: float[3] rgbData = sim.getObjectColor(int objectHandle, int index, int colorComponent)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
2. index: zero-based index of the color, if the object has several colors
3. colorComponent: color component
outputs:
1. rgbData: red, green and blue components of the color (3 values)
